OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'terrible joke' that scuppered
OL,4,AMatthew Rhys' James Bond hopes         
OL,6,FHollywood actor Matthew Rhys has told  
OL,7,Fhow a "terrible joke" he made during a 
OL,8,FJames Bond audition may have scuppered 
OL,9,Fhis chances of being cast in the iconic
OL,10,Frole.                                  
OL,12,FRhys went to the offices of the        
OL,13,FBroccoli family [who produced Bond     
OL,14,Ffilms] in London to audition for the   
OL,15,Frole in the early 2000s but said he was
OL,16,Fcaught off guard by one particular     
OL,17,Fquestion.                              
