OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'terrible joke' that scuppered
OL,4,AMatthew Rhys' James Bond hopes         
OL,6,FAppearing on Conan O'Brien's podcast,  
OL,7,Fthe actor said he was first asked if he
OL,8,Fhad read Casino Royale before being    
OL,9,Fasked "so what would you do differently
OL,10,Fwith Bond?"                            
OL,12,FThe 51-year-old, from Cardiff, said    
OL,13,Fthat "as a terrible joke, I said       
OL,14,F'limp'" and the room went quiet "so I  
OL,15,Fthought I would double down and said   
OL,16,F'eye patch' and then I just fell       
OL,17,Fapart".                                
